<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερεείνω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>inquire into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερέεινεν ἕκαστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				<i>inquire after,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ . . φίλον πόσιν ἐξερεείνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.86
				</span></i>
			; <i>inquire of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλος ἄλλον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1250
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>make inquiry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.672
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερεείνετο μύθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.81
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>search thoroughly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρους ἁλὸς ἐξερεείνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.259
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					252
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of a harp, <i>try</i> its <i>tones, tune</i> it,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				483
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
